repository-code: "https://github.com/armtfgh/flowpilot"
abstract: >-
  FlowPilot combines chemical planning, literature retrieval, deterministic
  engineering calculations and specialist-agent review to propose continuous-flow
  screening designs from batch protocols and laboratory constraints.
keywords:
  - flow chemistry
  - batch-to-flow
  - multi-agent systems
  - process design
  - retrieval-augmented generation
